[{"answer":"Hi Bobby, go ahead and sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Tell me about your research project.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I decided to research football,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and keys for success on a football team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/4.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the guidelines for the test?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Did the teacher talk to you about it in class?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/7.mp3"},{"answer":"No, everything is on a handout that was passed out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It says that the first draft is due at the end of next week,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and the second and third are due later on in the month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't understand why we have to keep revising and fixing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Is this assignment really that important?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, this project is a major requirement for passing 11th grade English and will go on your permanent record.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Does that mean it will affect what English level I am placed in next year?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You need a good grade to move on, but it is your overall grade","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and teacher recommendation that determines what level of English you are placed in next year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, tell me about your topic choice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you play football?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, actually it's because my father loves the sport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/21.mp3"},{"answer":"He watches it every weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Cool! It's a good idea to report on something you're interested in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I see you worked hard calling players and the head coach to talk,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/24.mp3"},{"answer":"so let's see what information you got.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, you have to listen carefully to the first call on the recording.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It's really hard to hear because the background noise is louder than the person's voice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is a bit tough to discern.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid the player's answer is too short as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/29.mp3"},{"answer":"You will have to interview him again and try to get him to give a better answer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that might happen.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I will call him again tomorrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Moving on, let's look back at this question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/34.mp3"},{"answer":"You asked, \"Tell me about a time when you learned a major life lesson through playing football,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/35.mp3"},{"answer":"and explain how that has shaped the person and player you have become now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/36.mp3"},{"answer":"and how you hope to pass on that lesson.\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It is a great idea for a question,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but in an oral interview it is far too complex.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I would advise you to break it up into multiple parts to get a better response.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess you're right -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/41.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't want to have to provide an answer to a question like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I will simplify it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I found that when I asked players this question, it took too much time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/44.mp3"},{"answer":"because they were struggling to answer the question completely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/45.mp3"},{"answer":"In fact, this is the question Joe Billings was answering when the tape ran out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/46.mp3"},{"answer":"He did tend to ramble on all the questions, didn't he?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/47.mp3"},{"answer":"He sure did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I would recommend that when you go back and interview players again","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/49.mp3"},{"answer":"that you use a more sophisticated recording device.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/50.mp3"},{"answer":"This recording is spotty,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/51.mp3"},{"answer":"which indicates that the equipment wasn't working consistently.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/53.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess it probably wasn't the best idea to use the sound recorder on my phone.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Hey, could you give me some feedback on the content of the report itself?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's start by focusing on your topic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/57.mp3"},{"answer":"While I like that you chose to cover football,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/58.mp3"},{"answer":"it seems inexplicit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/59.mp3"},{"answer":"The keys for success of a player and team is quite an interesting topic,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/60.mp3"},{"answer":"but what is your thesis?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That is to say, what conclusions can you draw from your research?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I would suggest coming up with a strong thesis statement","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/63.mp3"},{"answer":"and then shaping your report based on that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it really too vague?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/65.mp3"},{"answer":"I put a whole lot of facts into it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I list the top 10 goal-scorers in football history,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/67.mp3"},{"answer":"and later on provide statistics for a few of the most famous coaches and their records as coaches.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's great that you included these facts,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/69.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think you focused too much on the facts","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/70.mp3"},{"answer":"and not enough on connecting these facts to make your point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, I see. Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/72.mp3"},{"answer":"So it looks like I have quite a bit of work to do before the deadline!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-recent-actual-test-8-part-3-2023-06-22-23-16-07/73.mp3"}]
